</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname"><sup id="id5" class="ltx_sup">1</sup>University of California, Merced, USA  <sup id="id6" class="ltx_sup">2</sup>George Mason University, USA  <sup id="id7" class="ltx_sup">3</sup>OpenAI, USA
