<p id="Sx2.I4.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Reproduce Figure <a href="#S5.F11" title="Fig. 11 ‣ V-C UVM Optimization for DL Workloads ‣ V Case Studies Using Tools Built with Pasta ‣ PASTA: A Modular Program Analysis Tool Framework for Accelerators" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>.
Figure <a href="#S5.F11" title="Fig. 11 ‣ V-C UVM Optimization for DL Workloads ‣ V Case Studies Using Tools Built with Pasta ‣ PASTA: A Modular Program Analysis Tool Framework for Accelerators" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> shows execution time of object-level and tensor-level prefetch on RTX 3060 and A100 under no memory oversubscription.</p>
</div>
