Figure <a href="#S5.F13" title="Fig. 13 ‣ V-C UVM Optimization for DL Workloads ‣ V Case Studies Using Tools Built with Pasta ‣ PASTA: A Modular Program Analysis Tool Framework for Accelerators" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a> shows memory access hotness of BERT inference over time.</p>
</div>
<figure id="LSTx13" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
<div id="LSTx13.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_bash ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing" style="--ltx-border-color:#000000;"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64,YmFzaCAuL2Jpbi9ydW5fZmlndXJlXzEzLnNo" download="">⬇</a></div>
