<div id="Sx2.I4.i9.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx2.I4.i9.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Sx2.I4.i9.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">On NVIDIA GPU:</span>
After run the experiment for Figure 14 on AMD GPU, please move the <span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink ltx_path ltx_font_typewriter ltx_ref_self">out_amd.log</span> to NVIDIA server under <span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink ltx_path ltx_font_typewriter ltx_ref_self">results/figure_14/</span>.</p>
</div>
