<li id="Sx2.I4.i10" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Sx2.I4.i10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx2.I4.i10.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Reproduce Figure <a href="#S5.F15" title="Fig. 15 ‣ V-C2 Time-Series Hotness Analysis ‣ V-C UVM Optimization for DL Workloads ‣ V Case Studies Using Tools Built with Pasta ‣ PASTA: A Modular Program Analysis Tool Framework for Accelerators" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>.
Figure <a href="#S5.F15" title="Fig. 15 ‣ V-C2 Time-Series Hotness Analysis ‣ V-C UVM Optimization for DL Workloads ‣ V Case Studies Using Tools Built with Pasta ‣ PASTA: A Modular Program Analysis Tool Framework for Accelerators" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a> shows per-GPU memory usage over time in GPT-2 345M model training with different parallelism strategies.
The reproduction of Figure 15 requires Megatron-LM <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib56" title="" class="ltx_ref">40</a>]</cite> to be installed.</p>
</div>
<figure id="LSTx16" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
<div id="LSTx16.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_bash ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing" style="--ltx-border-color:#000000;"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64,YmFzaCAuL2Jpbi9ydW5fZmlndXJlXzE1LnNoIHBhdGhfdG9fbWVnYXRyb24=" download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx65" class="ltx_listingline">
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1</span>
                    
                    
                    
