<section id="Sx2.SS6" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="Sx2.SS6.6" class="ltx_text">VII-F</span> </span><span id="Sx2.SS6.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Evaluation and expected result</span></h3>

<div id="Sx2.SS6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx2.SS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The reproduced results are located in folder <span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink ltx_path ltx_font_typewriter ltx_ref_self">./results</span>.
The outputs for Figure <a href="#S5.F7" title="Fig. 7 ‣ V-B1 Kernel Invocation Frequency Analysis ‣ V-B Common Application Behaviors Analysis ‣ V Case Studies Using Tools Built with Pasta ‣ PASTA: A Modular Program Analysis Tool Framework for Accelerators" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>, Table <a href="#S5.T5" title="TABLE V ‣ V-B1 Kernel Invocation Frequency Analysis ‣ V-B Common Application Behaviors Analysis ‣ V Case Studies Using Tools Built with Pasta ‣ PASTA: A Modular Program Analysis Tool Framework for Accelerators" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">V</span></a>, Figure <a href="#S5.F9" title="Fig. 9 ‣ V-B2 Memory Characteristics Analysis ‣ V-B Common Application Behaviors Analysis ‣ V Case Studies Using Tools Built with Pasta ‣ PASTA: A Modular Program Analysis Tool Framework for Accelerators" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>,  <a href="#S5.F10" title="Fig. 10 ‣ V-B2 Memory Characteristics Analysis ‣ V-B Common Application Behaviors Analysis ‣ V Case Studies Using Tools Built with Pasta ‣ PASTA: A Modular Program Analysis Tool Framework for Accelerators" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>,  <a href="#S5.F11" title="Fig. 11 ‣ V-C UVM Optimization for DL Workloads ‣ V Case Studies Using Tools Built with Pasta ‣ PASTA: A Modular Program Analysis Tool Framework for Accelerators" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>,  <a href="#S5.F12" title="Fig. 12 ‣ V-C UVM Optimization for DL Workloads ‣ V Case Studies Using Tools Built with Pasta ‣ PASTA: A Modular Program Analysis Tool Framework for Accelerators" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>,  <a href="#S5.F13" title="Fig. 13 ‣ V-C UVM Optimization for DL Workloads ‣ V Case Studies Using Tools Built with Pasta ‣ PASTA: A Modular Program Analysis Tool Framework for Accelerators" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>,  <a href="#S5.F14" title="Fig. 14 ‣ V-C2 Time-Series Hotness Analysis ‣ V-C UVM Optimization for DL Workloads ‣ V Case Studies Using Tools Built with Pasta ‣ PASTA: A Modular Program Analysis Tool Framework for Accelerators" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a>, and  <a href="#S5.F15" title="Fig. 15 ‣ V-C2 Time-Series Hotness Analysis ‣ V-C UVM Optimization for DL Workloads ‣ V Case Studies Using Tools Built with Pasta ‣ PASTA: A Modular Program Analysis Tool Framework for Accelerators" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a> are expected to match the corresponding results in the paper.</p>
</div>
</section>
